<%# locals: (item:) %>

<%#
  A ledger row's comment and receipt counts. They share one wrapper so a stream
  can swap in fresh counts, including when a badge is hidden at zero; `contents`
  keeps the badges direct flex items of the memo cell.

  Replaced with `turbo_stream.replace [item, :badges]` by:
  - ReceiptsController, whenever a receipt on the item changes
  - CommentsController#destroy, when a comment is deleted from a popover
  - the transaction popovers, which reload after a comment is posted

  The counts are cached columns, but they're current by then: a receipt or
  comment touches its HCB code, which touches the item, which refreshes them.
%>
<div id="<%= dom_id(item, :badges) %>" class="contents">
  <%= list_badge_for auditor_signed_in? ? item.comment_count : item.not_admin_only_comment_count, "comment", "post", optional: true %>
  <%= list_badge_for item.receipt_count, "receipt", "payment-docs", optional: item.receipt_optional?, required: item.missing_receipt? %>
</div>
